{
  "_comment": [
    "Pages emitted by the (future) fetch script from Payload. This file mirrors",
    "exactly what that script will produce so the front-end can render without a",
    "live CMS.",
    "",
    "SHAPE:",
    "{ pages: PageData[] }",
    "  PageData = { slug: string, title?: {es,en}, layout: Block[] }",
    "    - slug: the URL path segment. '' or 'home' => '/'. Otherwise the path is",
    "      '/<slug>' (slugs may contain '/', e.g. 'proyectos/branding').",
    "    - layout: an ordered array of block instances.",
    "",
    "Block = { blockType: string, id?: string, ...fields }",
    "  - blockType is the Payload block `slug` (e.g. 'hero', 'projectGallery').",
    "  - Localized fields are objects { es, en } (rendered as field[language]).",
    "  - Language-agnostic fields (number, size, href, email, image path,",
    "    studioName, tool/language values) are plain scalars.",
    "  - Media/relationship refs are PRE-RESOLVED: a Hero backgroundImage becomes",
    "    `backgroundImagePath` (a string); an Image block's `image` is a string",
    "    path; a ProjectGallery's `projects` is an array of resolved cards:",
    "      { image: string, alt:{es,en}, category:{es,en}, title:{es,en} }.",
    "  - ProjectGallery.layoutVariant is one of: masonry-branding | grid-3 |",
    "    masonry-photo | grid-4 | single.",
    "",
    "See src/app/blocks/types.ts for the full per-block prop interfaces."
  ],
